@Energy.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5004

### Localization smoke test
GET {{Energy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/localization/test
Accept: application/json

### Home dashboard query
GET {{Energy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/home/dashboard?IncludeQuickLinks=true&QuickLinkCount=4
Accept: application/json

### Home seed command
POST {{Energy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/home/seed
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "seedIdentity": true,
  "seedPermissions": true,
  "seedMenus": true
}
